    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-7404-8877"
abstract: >
  Pre-registered independent study of whether TypeSafe AI's Jev lowers its
  confidence when humans disagree, on ChaosNLI. Bias-corrected soft ΔECE
  under equal-n entropy strata. Metrics and charts regenerate offline from
  committed JSONL via `make reproduce`. Pin jev-1.13.0.
keywords:
  - calibration
  - expected calibration error
  - Jev
  - System One
  - TypeSafe
  - ChaosNLI
  - preregistration
